OL,3,AMacron calls for calm in France and
OL,4,Awarns rioting must not escalate
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacron urged a distinction between the
OL,7,F"legitimate demands" of protesters and
OL,8,F"those who destroyed, smashed and
OL,9,Flooted". Police have arrested about
OL,10,F2,400 people.
